  "directive_events": [
    {
      "at": "2026-09-11T11:24:35.958828Z",
      "owner_directive": "Plan: (1) delete the GUI-disconnect grace cancel from ws.py; (2) new api/runtime/_run_lifetime.py: per-run owner marker (pid+create_time+host) written before the runs row, released after finalize; reconcile_interrupted_runs() on lineage-store open finalizes running rows whose owner process is gone as failed; shutdown_workflow_runs() cancels live runs with a bounded wait and force-finalizes stragglers as cancelled; (3) app.py lifespan: minimal hunk replacing the unbounded cancel+gather loop with runtime.shutdown_workflow_runs(). No core/schema change: reuses LineageStore.runs_in_progress/get_run/finalize_run and the existing failed/cancelled states.",
      "reason": "plan"
    }
  ],
